name: Keyboard-only frozen code reading and source-qualified human verdict preserve history
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_review_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | original-source-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
submit: decision fp Owned public documentation example is intentional
require-live-snap: 25 recorded observation revision-base-003 | original-human-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_review_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART advance
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 1 finding · 1 pending · TP: 0 · FP: 0 | source-stale-report
expect-not: 1 FP
submit: findings
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 review current source | source-form-action
keys: Y
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW CURRENT SOURCE | bounded-capture-terms
expect: 16 GiB
expect: no scan observations or provider requests
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 READ CAPTURED SOURCE | frozen-current-code
expect: Public documentation example
expect: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Source reference | source-receipt
expect: c557cdbf94b931ecc250b33d33d793f79036a908
expect: Dirty: true
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID | returned-code
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-form-160x48
expect: dirty
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-form-96x89
expect: dirty
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-form-80x24
expect: dirty
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-form-60x20
expect: dirty
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-form-40x12
expect: dirty
expect: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
keys: NPage
live-snap: source-form-40x12-code
ask: Is the code clearly frozen to the capture, with readable resource limits, source identity, controls and narrow-terminal paging?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CHOOSE SOURCE VERDICT | verdict-choices
keys: Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPLAIN SOURCE VERDICT | reason-editor
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 25 Add a reason | required-reason
paste-file: @ART/review-reason.txt
require-live-snap: 25 explicitly deferred | multiline-review-reason
expect-not: Add a reason
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-reason-160x48
expect: dirty
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-reason-96x89
expect: dirty
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-reason-80x24
expect: dirty
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-reason-60x20
expect: dirty
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 Ctrl+S review | source-reason-40x12
expect: SHA c557cdbf94b9
expect: dirty
resize: 120x36
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW SOURCE DECISION | reviewed-save
expect: Deferred
expect: Dirty: true
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-confirm-40x12
expect: dirty
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 25 SHA c557cdbf94b9 | source-confirm-40x12-identity
expect: dirty
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 SOURCE DECISION SAVED | durable-source-decision
expect: Decision #2 saved
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_review_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | returned-review-origin
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 1 finding · 0 pending · TP: 0 · FP: 0 · 1 deferred | source-reviewed-report
expect: 0 pending · 1 deferred
ask: Does Report keep the earlier FP decision pending after source drift, then show only the explicitly source-reviewed deferral without changing severity or claiming a fix?
submit: findings
ask: Does the entire source review avoid JSON entry, preserve the prior decision and raw observations, and return to Review after one explicit save?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: findings
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 explicitly reviewed source capture | recovered-source-review
expect: dirty
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_review_form.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 1 finding · 0 pending · TP: 0 · FP: 0 · 1 deferred | recovered-report-decisions
expect: 0 pending · 1 deferred
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
